    "sub_name": "金融素養",
    "sub_ename": "FINANCIAL LITERACY",
    "describe_ch": "針對理工組學生設計之課程，從基本的會計與金融認識起，內容主題有認識財務報表、財務比率、貨幣時間價值、風險與報酬、資金成本、投資案評估法則、管理會計主題。透過實務案例教科書，學生從閱讀案例中認識金融。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is designed for science students to learn the basic knowledge in Accounting and Finance. The topics of this course are financial statements, financial ratios, the time value of money, risk and return, the cost of capital, criteria for investment decision rule, and managerial accounting. Through the practical textbook of case study, these students learn financial knowledge from reading practical cases.",
